      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The town sits in the Indian Creek watershed, part of the Youghiogheny River basin, supporting trout streams and wetlands.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        4
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
